2. Sorting
Depending on the selected option, books with notes can be sorted by the
following categories:
    • Most recent first;
    • By title (A — Z);
    • By author (A — Z);
    • By number of notes.


To sort notes, select the icon        , or tap on the icon        , and select Sort by.


In the menu that opens, notes can be sorted by the following categories:


    • By page 1 — 99;
    • By page 99 — 1;
    • Newest first;
    • Oldest first.




